            ["Get out of there!"] = "human-male\\npc_lowHealth_5.ogg",
            ["Drink something! Anything!"] = "human-male\\npc_lowHealth_6.ogg",
            ["This isn't worth dying over!"] = "human-male\\npc_lowHealth_7.ogg",
            ["Run! I'll tell everyone you were brave!"] = "human-male\\npc_lowHealth_8.ogg",
            ["Bandage! Potion! Something!"] = "human-male\\npc_lowHealth_9.ogg",
            ["Hang on! Don't you dare go down!"] = "human-male\\npc_lowHealth_10.ogg",
            ["Looks like you've got mail."] = "human-male\\npc_mail_1.ogg",
            ["Someone's written to you. How nice."] = "human-male\\npc_mail_2.ogg",
            ["A letter! I hope it's good news."] = "human-male\\npc_mail_3.ogg",
            ["Mail for you. Somebody's thinking of you."] = "human-male\\npc_mail_4.ogg",
            ["Level {level}! There's nothing left to teach you, is there?"] = "human-male\\npc_maxLevel_1.ogg",
            ["The very top! I'm honored to have come along for it."] = "human-male\\npc_maxLevel_2.ogg",
            ["That's the peak. Where do you go from here? Anywhere you like, I suppose."] = "human-male\\npc_maxLevel_3.ogg",
            ["A mount? Fine. A gryphon would be faster, but fine."] = "human-male\\lore523_mount_1.ogg",
            ["Riding in style, I see."] = "human-male\\npc_mount_1.ogg",
            ["Fine animal you've got there."] = "human-male\\npc_mount_2.ogg",
            ["I'll just walk alongside, shall I?"] = "human-male\\npc_mount_3.ogg",
            ["Now that's a proper way to travel."] = "human-male\\npc_mount_4.ogg",
            ["Does it have a name? It looks like it should have a name."] = "human-male\\npc_mount_5.ogg",
            ["{friend} seems friendly."] = "human-male\\npc_newFriend_1.ogg",
            ["I've heard good things about {friend}."] = "human-male\\npc_newFriend_2.ogg",
            ["Another friend! You collect them like coins."] = "human-male\\npc_newFriend_3.ogg",
            ["Another friendly face. You're good at this."] = "human-male\\npc_newFriend_4.ogg",
            ["You make friends faster than I make tea."] = "human-male\\npc_newFriend_5.ogg",
            ["What is it? I don't see anything."] = "human-male\\npc_pointToo_1.ogg",
            ["Where? Oh! No, I still don't see it."] = "human-male\\npc_pointToo_2.ogg",
            ["Is it something good? Or something bad?"] = "human-male\\npc_pointToo_3.ogg",
            ["Careful, these pockets are full of gryphon feed."] = "human-male\\lore523_poke_1.ogg",
            ["Yes, {name}?"] = "human-male\\npc_poke_1.ogg",
            ["Need a ride? Oh, right. We're walking."] = "human-male\\lore523_poke_2.ogg",
            ["Hm? Something on your mind?"] = "human-male\\npc_poke_2.ogg",
            ["I'm right here."] = "human-male\\npc_poke_3.ogg",
            ["Careful, now."] = "human-male\\npc_poke_4.ogg",
            ["Ha! You're a funny one."] = "human-male\\npc_poke_5.ogg",
            ["Need something?"] = "human-male\\npc_poke_6.ogg",
            ["Still here, still with you."] = "human-male\\npc_poke_7.ogg",
            ["What is it? Did you see something?"] = "human-male\\npc_poke_8.ogg",
            ["If that's how you say hello where you're from, all right."] = "human-male\\npc_poke_9.ogg",
            ["I'm listening."] = "human-male\\npc_poke_10.ogg",
            ["Still breathing, if that's what you're checking."] = "human-male\\npc_poke_11.ogg",
            ["Was that a poke or a question?"] = "human-male\\npc_poke_12.ogg",
            ["Easy! I bruise like a peach."] = "human-male\\npc_poke_13.ogg",
            ["You have my full attention. Mostly."] = "human-male\\npc_poke_14.ogg",
            ["Hm? Sorry, I was miles away."] = "human-male\\npc_poke_15.ogg",
            ["Ask away."] = "human-male\\npc_poke_16.ogg",
            ["Ow. Was that necessary?"] = "human-male\\npc_poke_17.ogg",
            ["What, did I miss something?"] = "human-male\\npc_poke_18.ogg",
            ["Present and accounted for."] = "human-male\\npc_poke_19.ogg",
            ["Yes, yes, I see you."] = "human-male\\npc_poke_20.ogg",
            ["All right, all right, I'm awake!"] = "human-male\\npc_pokeMany_1.ogg",
            ["Is this going to keep happening?"] = "human-male\\npc_pokeMany_2.ogg",
            ["You'd think I was a doorbell."] = "human-male\\npc_pokeMany_3.ogg",
            ["I'm starting to think you enjoy this."] = "human-male\\npc_pokeMany_4.ogg",
            ["Enough! I surrender!"] = "human-male\\npc_pokeMany_5.ogg",
            ["One more and I'm going home. I mean it. Probably."] = "human-male\\npc_pokeMany_6.ogg",
            ["Another errand run! Lewis would be proud."] = "human-male\\lore523_quest_1.ogg",
            ["Another job done. Nicely handled."] = "human-male\\npc_quest_1.ogg",
            ["Well done! They'll be grateful."] = "human-male\\npc_quest_2.ogg",
            ["You've a knack for helping folk."] = "human-male\\npc_quest_3.ogg",
            ["That's one more person sleeping easier tonight."] = "human-male\\npc_quest_4.ogg",
            ["Good work. Who's next?"] = "human-male\\npc_quest_5.ogg",
            ["Word gets around. People will remember that."] = "human-male\\npc_quest_6.ogg",
            ["Nicely done. Somebody's going to tell that story at the inn."] = "human-male\\npc_quest_7.ogg",
            ["That's the way!"] = "human-male\\npc_quest_8.ogg",
            ["You make it look easy."] = "human-male\\npc_quest_9.ogg",
            ["Done and done. What's next?"] = "human-male\\npc_quest_10.ogg",
            ["Another errand? I like your spirit."] = "human-male\\npc_questAccepted_1.ogg",
            ["Off we go, then."] = "human-male\\npc_questAccepted_2.ogg",
            ["Somebody's lucky you came along."] = "human-male\\npc_questAccepted_3.ogg",
            ["Here we go again. I love it."] = "human-male\\npc_questAccepted_4.ogg",
            ["Sounds like trouble. Count me in."] = "human-male\\npc_questAccepted_5.ogg",
            ["Hm? Did I doze off?"] = "human-male\\npc_reload_1.ogg",
            ["Strange. I could swear the world just blinked."] = "human-male\\npc_reload_2.ogg",
            ["Where was I? Oh, right. With you."] = "human-male\\npc_reload_3.ogg",
            ["Hm. I lost my train of thought. Something about the road."] = "human-male\\npc_reload_4.ogg",
            ["A good place to rest our feet."] = "human-male\\npc_rest_1.ogg",
            ["Nothing like a warm inn."] = "human-male\\npc_rest_2.ogg",
            ["I could sit here all day."] = "human-male\\npc_rest_3.ogg",
            ["A chair, a fire, good company. That's living."] = "human-male\\npc_rest_4.ogg",
            ["Let's stay a moment. My feet insist."] = "human-male\\npc_rest_5.ogg",
            ["Easy there, tiger."] = "human-male\\npc_roarBack_1.ogg",
            ["Very fierce. I'm terrified."] = "human-male\\npc_roarBack_2.ogg",
