            ["I wonder what the folks back home are gossiping about."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_35.ogg",
            ["Every time I think I've seen it all, you take me somewhere new."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_36.ogg",
            ["It's peaceful out here. Until it isn't."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_37.ogg",
            ["I could do with a cup of something warm."] = "nightelf-male\\npc_idle_38.ogg",
