            ["Getting late. The stars will be out soon."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_14.ogg",
            ["Quiet night. I like quiet nights."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_15.ogg",
            ["We've been at it for a while. You're tireless, you know that?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_16.ogg",
            ["I used to wonder what was past the next hill. Now I know: another hill."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_17.ogg",
            ["Do you ever get used to all this walking?"] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_18.ogg",
            ["I've heard stories about you, you know. Some of them are even nice."] = "skyborne-male\\npc_idle_19.ogg",
